    "detailed_description": "Take control of the small spaceship Phon in this frantic side-scrolling space shooter in which your main goal is to destroy as many enemies' spaceships as possible in a single run. Random powerups should help you reach further distances and destroy more enemies' spaceships in your action-packed run, but your skill will be the ultimate asset to reach for a great score! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Main features:<br />\r\n- Upgradable spaceship with over 10+ powerups that randomly drop;<br />\r\n- Fire exhaust/cool-down mechanism;<br />\r\n- Regular shot with unlimited number of bullets;<br />\r\n- Special and limited drop-bombs that blasts a greater number of enemies';<br />\r\n- Enemies' spaceships with increasing difficulty;<br />\r\n- Retro-style graphics;<br />\r\n- Hi-Score autosaving.",
